OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOn the cloudy side overall,
OL,6,Fwith early fog patches clearing to a
OL,7,Fmainly dry day with some bright or
OL,8,Fperhaps hazy sunny spells. Isolated
OL,9,Flight showers may move onshore in
OL,10,Fcoastal districts. Temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying rather cloudy for
OL,14,Fmany, however a slight frost may form
OL,15,Funder clear spells inland, with the
OL,16,Fodd light shower near coasts. Cloudier
OL,17,Fwith rain in far north by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
